ey will not say"},{"surface":"ஆயினும்","parts":[{"text":"ஆயினும்","lemma":"ஆயினும்","gloss":"even though"}],"gloss":"even though"},{"surface":"தமக்கு","parts":[{"text":"தமக்கு","lemma":"தமக்கு","gloss":"to them"}],"gloss":"to them"},{"surface":"ஒன்","parts":[{"text":"ஒன்","lemma":"ஒன்று","gloss":"one thing"}],"gloss":"one thing"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"றின்னா","parts":[{"text":"றின்னா","lemma":"றின்னா","gloss":"painful to one"}],"gloss":"painful to one","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"இரவின்","parts":[{"text":"இரவின்","lemma":"இரவு","gloss":"night"}],"gloss":"of the night"},{"surface":"இன்றுணை","parts":[{"text":"இன்","lemma":"இனிமை","gloss":"sweet"},{"text":"துணை","lemma":"துணை","gloss":"companion"}],"gloss":"sweet companion"},{"surface":"ஆகிய","parts":[{"text":"ஆகிய","lemma":"ஆகு","gloss":"who became"}],"gloss":"who became"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"படப்பை","parts":[{"text":"படப்பை","lemma":"படப்பை","gloss":"garden"}],"gloss":"garden"},{"surface":"வேங்கைக்கு","parts":[{"text":"வேங்கைக்கு","lemma":"வேங்கை","gloss":"Kino tree"}],"gloss":"to the Kino tree"},{"surface":"மறந்தனர்","parts":[{"text":"மறந்தனர்","lemma":"மறத்தல்","gloss":"they forgot"}],"gloss":"they forgot"},{"surface":"கொல்லோ","parts":[{"text":"கொல்லோ","lemma":"கொல்லோ","gloss":"particle of doubt"}],"gloss":"indeed"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"மறப்பு","parts":[{"text":"மறப்பு","lemma":"மறப்பு","gloss":"forgetfulness"}],"gloss":"forgetfulness"},{"surface":"உரும்","parts":[{"text":"உரும்","lemma":"உறும்","gloss":"experiencing"}],"gloss":"experiencing"},{"surface":"பணை","parts":[{"text":"பணை","lemma":"பணை","gloss":"bamboo-like"}],"gloss":"bamboo-like"},{"surface":"தோள்","parts":[{"text":"தோள்","lemma":"தோள்","gloss":"shoulder"}],"gloss":"shoulder"},{"surface":"மரீஇத்","parts":[{"text":"மரீஇ","lemma":"மருவு","gloss":"having embraced"},{"text":"த்","lemma":"த்","gloss":"doubled consonant"}],"gloss":"having embraced"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"துறத்தல்","parts":[{"text":"துறத்தல்","lemma":"துறத்தல்","gloss":"abandoning"}],"gloss":"abandoning"},{"surface":"வல்லியோர்","parts":[{"text":"வல்லியோர்","lemma":"வல்லோர்","gloss":"those who are capable"}],"gloss":"those who are capable"},{"surface":"புள்","parts":[{"text":"புள்","lemma":"புள்","gloss":"bird"}],"gloss":"bird"},{"surface":"வாய்த்","parts":[{"text":"வாய்","lemma":"வாய்","gloss":"mouth"},{"text":"த்","lemma":"த்","gloss":"doubled consonant"}],"gloss":"mouth"},{"surface":"தூதே","parts":[{"text":"தூது","lemma":"தூது","gloss":"message"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"the message"}]}],"literal":"To us one thing they will not say, even though / to them one thing painful of the night sweet companion who became / garden Kino tree to they forgot indeed? / forgetfulness experiencing bamboo-like shoulders having embraced / abandoning those who are capable, bird mouth message.","translation":"Even if he does not say a word to us, has he forgotten the Vēṅkai tree in our garden, which was his sweet companion during the painful nights? He who is capable of embracing my bamboo-like shoulders and then abandoning them, now relies on the messages carried in the mouths of birds.","modern":"அவர் நமக்கு ஒரு வார்த்தையும் சொல்லவில்லை என்றாலும், துன்பம் தரும் இரவில் தனக்கு இனிய துணையாக இருந்த நம் வீட்டுத் தோட்டத்து வேங்கை மரத்தையாவது மறந்துவிட்டாரா? என் மூங்கில் போன்ற தோள்களைத் தழுவிப் பின் என்னைப் பிரிந்து செல்லத் துணிந்த அவர், பறவைகளின் வாயிலாகத் தூது அனுப்புவதில் வல்லவர் போலும்!","explanation":"The heroine is speaking to her friend in the landscape of Pālai (separation). The hero has left her to acquire wealth, and she is suffering from his absence. She wonders if he has forgotten not only her but also the Vēṅkai (Kino) tree in her backyard, which used to be his companion when he waited for her during his secret night visits. The image of the Vēṅkai tree, which blooms during the separation season, intensifies her grief. She sarcastically remarks that he who was strong enough to abandon her is now sending messages through birds, highlighting her despair and his apparent indifference. Key words include 'வேங்கை' (Kino tree), 'பணைத்தோள்' (bamboo-like shoulders), and 'தூது' (message).","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.8],[0.85,1.12],[1.12,1.6],[1.6,3.41],[3.41,3.6],[3.6,3.68],[3.68,3.91],[3.91,4.3],[4.3,5.6],[5.6,5.6],[5.6,6.2],[6.2,6.7],[6.7,6.7],[6.7,7.4],[7.4,8.1],[8.1,9.7],[9.7,9.7],[9.7,10.77],[10.77,11.0]],"female":[[0.0,0.82],[0.82,1.14],[1.14,1.7],[1.7,2.98],[3.28,3.8],[3.8,3.87],[3.87,4.07],[4.07,4.4],[4.4,5.7],[5.7,5.8],[5.8,6.5],[6.5,7.0],[7.0,7.0],[7.0,8.0],[8.0,9.89],[9.89,10.33],[10.33,10.33],[10.33,12.2],[12.2,12.5]]}}